{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-13",
  "title": "不錯的回憶",
  "storyCode": "6-15",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6a7469f7bed5f3e9273ea18cd919da707fc84f65f898c343cf6167019a77b3d0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（煌。我需要你帶隊建立優勢。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "（你想組織一場突襲？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（我很擔憂現在的情況。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（現在，我們和雪怪都依靠各自的手法確定了博士和霜星的位置。你的法術很成功，他們現在很安全。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（然而......兩人的位置太接近了。只要能救出其中一個，另一個就會被一同救上來。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（有兩件事情是我們現在沒法確定的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（一是，會是誰先發掘出博士和霜星......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "（另一個，就是霜星的態度了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（沒錯。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（如果是我們獲得先機，我們就必須立即制服霜星，但也要用她換取雪怪小隊的認同。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（這樣的話，我們不僅能避免戰鬥，也能獲得更深層的交流機會。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（如果是對方先救出領袖......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "阿、阿米婭，心跳探測儀有反應了，我們確定了精確位置，深度還不確定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哎......等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "怎麼急急忙忙就衝出去了，啊喲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "一牽涉到博士的事，馬上就變得慌慌張張，甚至會把平常的習慣丟在一旁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "真不知道該說這是阿米婭她的缺點，還是她的特長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你想，她剛才做的那些推測，根本不像是她平常會說的話。過於快狠準了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "還好，她沒有走到偷襲那步。這個該我們去做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "不完全是。現在偷襲雪怪小隊，雪怪們一定殊死抵抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我的目標是營救各位，而不是造成我們更大的傷亡。她沒放棄最優解的那部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......看來該道歉的是我。我傭兵思維太重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你也沒直接動手不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒有被近在眼前的戰鬥勝利衝昏頭腦，而是堅守原本的戰術目標，這才是我信任的作為戰地指揮官的阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我去雪怪那兒看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這結構......太複雜了，我有點摸不著頭腦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你給我描述一下，我來做圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？我中學第八年級的教材都沒念完，饒了我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你上課時候又幹什麼去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "訓練去了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不然你讓大熊試試？他不是有那種法術嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他是念念詩寫寫文章那方面的，和你這種結構探測是兩回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你用算式表達試試，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸，還挺不錯的，我數學還行，就這樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你有沒有感覺有點熱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是吧，我可是穿這麼厚也感覺得到大姊的源石能把我凍掉層皮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好啊，羅德島的貓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "不好意思，我只要一流汗，周圍就會變熱，然後我就會繼續流汗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "幸虧有你們，我感覺比平常涼快多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你很緊張嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "有一點。畢竟我沒想到會和敵人共事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": ".....至少現在，可以不把我們當敵人。挖出來大姊以後，她說什麼我們照辦，但那是之後的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......你們和其他整合運動真的不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又有幾個整合運動的成員是一樣的？你會覺得你和那隻小兔子是一樣類型的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嚯。你說的還蠻對的，我們這兒也是什麼人都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到哪都一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至少你們肯聽我們說話，以前我們遇到的烏薩斯士兵，都是二話不說就射擊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "箭矢乒鈴乓啷地射得到處都是，之後就是打起來，到一方死光了才結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "畢竟我們不是烏薩斯士兵，是製藥公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "製藥公司有你們這種裝備？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "現在形勢比較亂，大家都得有保護自己的手段，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......如果能把這些打來打去的時間用來種地就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果能多種一季紅麥，就有至少半個聚落的感染者不用挨餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果不是饑餓，他們也不會去那座小城，更不會被射殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果，哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "他還挺多愁善感的。不，我覺得烏薩斯人都有點多愁善感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼在這偷懶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，不好意思。該回去幹活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒事，你們忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "不過你身上帶著的那個，香味真足啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？這......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒事，沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哎，有點饞啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你，你看我幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "15:22 P.M.\n切爾諾伯格分城“14區”廢墟\n區塊地面\n挖掘作業三小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "阿米婭，收手吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你的手指已經血流不止了......！別再用手挖了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可我......我感受到情感了，就在這下面......就在這下面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "用工具的話，我感受不到......我必須用手指才摸得到那種細小的感覺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "阿米婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "已經很近了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "（隕星......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（可是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "（讓她去吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果讓他們先找到的話......如果讓他們先找到的話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒事，你可以的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員D",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要用法術？我，我不行啊，這個我真不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除了大姊我們就沒人會這種類型的法術了啊？快點快點，只要把這兩邊的溫度變得不一樣就行，差距越大越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員D",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就試試......失敗了可別怪我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除了怪你，還能怪誰啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別折騰他了，讓他集中精神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "就是這裡，就是這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......牆體？我挖錯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "對，只要打碎它，打碎它......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可這裡坍塌的話......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我......挖錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "打開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "煌！隕星！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "做好準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你贏了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我會輸嗎？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你沒有給我能贏的選項。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大姊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......這個人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這個人就是羅德島所說的博士吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "要殺要剮悉聽尊便！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你好。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "羅德島的領袖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "是我。可以叫我阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "（她的戒指......戒指在變紅？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "（你不阻止她？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "（我沒有理由阻止我們唯一的勝機。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "煌！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我尊重阿米婭的選擇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，不。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "大熊，羅德島是不是沒有和你們交戰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大熊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "沒有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......那麼在這片戰場上，我們就不是敵人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "霜星......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "不是敵人就沒有理由廝殺了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "請回吧，博士。回到你的隊伍裡去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......不愧是大姊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "需要你誇嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "安靜些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "小兔子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "呃，我叫阿米婭......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "你們也要前往龍門，對嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "那我們遲早會是敵人，小兔子。只是，現在還不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "霜星，你和你的小隊並不像其他整合運動一樣嗜殺、混亂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "別指責我的同胞。你並不清楚他們經歷過什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "可你也不願意看著他們這樣下去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......哦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "你似乎能看穿我的想法？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我不能。但我能隱約感受到你的不安和局促。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "這些都將在龍門陷落後一掃而空。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "羅德島其實......能夠理解你和你的小隊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "也許你會反駁，會認為我根本不理解你們......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但霜星小姐，他們經歷過什麼，我清清楚楚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......幼稚。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星，你身上的衣服，不是你的吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "沒錯。這曾經是“愛國者”的斗篷。我把它改織成了外衣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "你是怎麼看出來的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "算了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "每個人都會有自己說不出來的事情吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "霜星小姐，羅德島不想和任何人發生不必要的衝突。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "又有哪種發生了的衝突是必要的呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "至少我們不想與你的小隊作戰！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "他們都是正直善良的人。傷害他們，或者讓他們傷害無辜的人，絕對違背了我們的意願！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......那就祈禱我們別再見面吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "霜星小姐！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我可能也沒那麼想傷害各位。但如果必要的話，我會把各位全都殺掉。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你可以來羅德島。我們可以不再互相戰鬥。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "那你可以試著打贏我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "如果你戰勝了我，我可以考慮一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "只不過，我們只要在戰場上相見，那就會是敵人。身為敵人，就是會互相殘殺，不死不休。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "對了，這個，給那隻小狐狸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "......什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "治療凍傷的特效藥。獨家秘方。至少能緩解燒灼感和疼痛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我研究這東西很久了，剛才那一仗，你打的很不錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "捨己為人的戰士，在我眼裡是最強的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "謝謝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "霜星......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "啊，等等，那我也有要說的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "雪怪1號！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊......啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "怎麼回事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "下次一起喝點！伏特加真夠香的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "別說出來啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "唔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "哈哈......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "再見，羅德島。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "希望我們不會再見面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "龍門下層結構"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "你果然會在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好，霜星。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "你們好，羅德島。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
